211
00:11:49.142 --> 00:11:51.120
If the cow flicks
the cake forward.

212
00:11:51.144 --> 00:11:53.656
it means it's going to
be a very good harvest.

213
00:11:53.680 --> 00:11:56.592
Oh. Well. that's very
thoughtful of you. Wilson.

214
00:11:56.616 --> 00:11:59.562
Well. Jill. it's all part of the
