243
00:13:30.210 --> 00:13:33.089
Well. well. well.
look who's home.

244
00:13:33.113 --> 00:13:34.857
How did it go?

245
00:13:34.881 --> 00:13:37.059
Oh. OK.

246
00:13:37.083 --> 00:13:39.428
